---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// BeP09 figure: BeP09DbPerTest
---
<figure class="bep9n4">
  <div class="bep9n4-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 285" role="img" aria-label="Three tests, each connected to its own fresh SQLite file under tmp_path. Each file starts empty, so one test never sees the rows of another.">
    <text x="380" y="28" text-anchor="middle" class="code">tmp_path</text>
    <rect x="40" y="48" width="150" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="115" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>test 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>test 1</tspan></text>
    <line x1="190" y1="76" x2="320" y2="76" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="330,76 320,71 320,81" class="hd" />
    <rect x="330" y="48" width="260" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={366} y={76} size={24} />
    <text x="398" y="82" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>a fresh file for test 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một file mới cho test 1</tspan></text>
    <text x="620" y="82" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>starts empty</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bắt đầu rỗng</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="128" width="150" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="115" y="162" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>test 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>test 2</tspan></text>
    <line x1="190" y1="156" x2="320" y2="156" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="330,156 320,151 320,161" class="hd" />
    <rect x="330" y="128" width="260" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={366} y={156} size={24} />
    <text x="398" y="162" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>a fresh file for test 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một file mới cho test 2</tspan></text>
    <text x="620" y="162" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>starts empty</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bắt đầu rỗng</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="208" width="150" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="115" y="242" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>test 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>test 3</tspan></text>
    <line x1="190" y1="236" x2="320" y2="236" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="330,236 320,231 320,241" class="hd" />
    <rect x="330" y="208" width="260" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={366} y={236} size={24} />
    <text x="398" y="242" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>a fresh file for test 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một file mới cho test 3</tspan></text>
    <text x="620" y="242" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>starts empty</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bắt đầu rỗng</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>One database file per test means no test inherits another one's rows, so the order the tests run in stops mattering.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mỗi test một file database nên không test nào thừa hưởng dữ liệu của test khác, và thứ tự chạy không còn quan trọng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep9n4 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep9n4-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep9n4 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep9n4 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep9n4 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9n4 .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9n4 .bs { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep9n4 .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep9n4 .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep9n4 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep9n4 .redbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9n4 .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep9n4 .redln { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9n4 .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep9n4 .redhd { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9n4 .bar { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep9n4 .redbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9n4 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
